        "headline": {
          "en": "4-Color Demons",
          "zh": "四色恶魔"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "The deck still follows the old Tablet control plan, but no longer maxes out on Tablet of Discovery and Jeskai Revelation. Instead, it adds the Firdoch Core and Unholy Annex interaction. Compared with the burst of resolving Revelation on turn five, this version has a steadier resource engine and stronger life-gain and life-drain. It may be one of the best decks in the current metagame.",
          "zh": "整体还是以前石板控的思路，但不再满编石板和启示，而是加入杉石人核心和恶魔隔间的配合，相比5费回合打启示的爆发，这一套的资源要更坚实，回血撮血能力也强。个人认为很可能是现在环境中最好的套牌之一。"
        },
