        "headline": {
          "en": "Sultai Demon",
          "zh": "苏勒台恶魔"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "The deck is essentially mono-black, splashing blue for Deceit and lightly splashing green for single copies of Maelstrom Pulse, Professor Dellian Fel, and the four-mana sweeper. Fundamentally, however, it is a Together as One deck, using several Black Verge lands to provide the other colors. Firdoch Core ramps and fixes for Together as One while also serving as a Demon to trigger Unholy Annex, giving the deck explosive long-game value.",
          "zh": "套牌基本是纯黑，沾蓝施放欺瞒，微混绿带了涡心鼓动、黑绿教授、4费扫场各1。但本质是个携力如一套牌，带了很多黑边陲产其他色。用杉石人核心ramp+调色出携力如一，并可以作为恶魔触发隔间，长盘价值爆炸。"
        },
