    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "After Landfall topped the metagame for three consecutive weeks, the field began to shift. Landfall, Spellementals, and Dimir remain the leading decks, but Spellementals overtook the field in both tracked shares to claim first place. Boros Dwarves, which joined the metagame last week, still held roughly a 5% share.",
          "zh": "在地落连续霸榜三周之后，本周环境开始有一些变化。顶端还是地落、元素、蓝黑三套，但元素两项占比本周都实现了反超，登上头名。上周开始成为环境组成部分的红白矮人套牌，本周依旧能保持5%的占比。"
        }
      },
