          }
        ],
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "New contenders also entered the metagame. Two Unholy Annex control decks posted strong results. The first was McWinSauce's list: deck:79c590f0205dbbdbf928. It is fundamentally a Together as One deck, using several black verge lands to supply the other colors. Firdoch Core both ramps and fixes for Together as One, while also serving as a Demon to trigger Unholy Annex, creating tremendous long-game value.",
          "zh": "同时还有新势力进入环境。两套恶魔隔间控都取得不错的成绩。首先是McWinsauce的：deck:79c590f0205dbbdbf928。本质是个携力如一套牌，带了很多黑边陲产其他色。用杉石人核心ramp+调色出携力如一，并可以作为恶魔触发隔间，长盘价值爆炸。"
        }
      },
      {
