            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:2b828363fb5b9881ee8a"
          }
        ],
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "en": "The other Unholy Annex control deck to break out this week was deck:2b828363fb5b9881ee8a. It first appeared in last week's over-100-player RCQ in Japan and earned a qualification slot. MTGO players then picked it up and produced strong results. Japanese player ryuumei reached the Top 4 first, and McWinSauce later made another Top 4 with the same list, alongside several other high finishes.",
          "zh": "本周杀出的另一套隔间控制牌是：deck:2b828363fb5b9881ee8a。最开始出现是上周日本100+人RCQ上拿到资格，之后在MO上有人抄取也有出色表现。先是日本牌手ryuumei操控拿下四强，然后构筑上面苏勒台版本的McWinsauce也用同样的牌表取得四强，之外还有不少高分成绩。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "jund-artifact-sacrifice",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "8e90347fdbbb996f10c5556f672b3da6798abfa89a2ea4396b446610e638eba7",
              "deck_id": "3a2766382a9a6dff793f",
