            },
            "label": {
              "en": "Jund Artifact Sacrifice · filpin · Rank 1",
              "zh": "勇得神器牺牲 · filpin · 第1名"
            },
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:3a2766382a9a6dff793f"
          }
        ],
        "order": 4,
        "text": {
          "en": "Jund Artifact Sacrifice also topped one event this week: deck:3a2766382a9a6dff793f. Similar lists occasionally appeared on the ladder, built around Biotech Specialist from EOE and Obsessive Pursuit from TLA, but they had never reached the high-finishing ranks of an MTGO event. Both cards—especially Obsessive Pursuit—look very powerful, but the archetype previously lacked the right shell. The Sackville-Bagginses from HOB may be the missing piece: a sacrifice outlet, Treasure acceleration, and a sacrifice-based damage engine that fits the rest of the deck extremely well.",
          "zh": "还有一套勇德神器牺牲套牌本周可以席卷一场：deck:3a2766382a9a6dff793f。以前天梯上偶尔能见到类似思路的套牌，以EOE的生质科技专家和TLA偏执追击为核心，不过MO比赛中高分区从来没出现过。但个人认为这两张牌，尤其是偏执追击的强度还是非常高的，只是暂时没有合适的结构。HOB的萨克维尔巴金斯家族可能一定程度上补足了这个结构，作为单次牺牲源+珍宝加速+牺牲打血引擎，整体和现有结构都非常搭。"
        }
      }
